# {{ .DisplayName }}

A Konstera agent, scaffolded by `konstera init`.

## Build

```bash
konstera manifest validate manifest.json
konstera build
```

Or without the CLI:

```bash
docker buildx build -t {{ .AgentId }}:{{ .Version }} .
```

## Local test (direct-run, no kernel needed)

```bash
npm install
npm run dev  # starts an HTTP server on :8080
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/invoke -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"input":"friend","invocationId":"local-test"}'
```

Expect: `{"content":"Hello, friend! From {{ .AgentName }}."}`.

## Deploy

```bash
konstera deploy
```

Or manually: upload via the portal (Agents → Upload package).

